(REQUEST FOR PROPOSAL \(RFP\) - MUNICIPAL SMART CITY IOT PLATFORM) '
(Tender Reference Number: SUIA-RFP-2026-IOT-098) '
(Issuing Authority: National Smart Urban Infrastructure Authority) '
(Project: Centralized Urban IoT Edge Ingestion & Automated Command Platform) '
(Estimated Contract Value: INR 6,50,00,000 \(INR 6.50 Crore\)) '
(Submission Deadline: 30 Days from NIT Publication) '
(SECTION 1: INVITATION & SCOPE SUMMARY) '
(1.1 Electronic proposals are invited from qualified Enterprise System Integrators.) '
(1.2 The scope includes edge hardware deployment, central telemetry ingestion clusters,) '
(real-time GIS visual command dashboards, and 3 years of 24/7 SLA maintenance.) '
(1.3 Bidding operates under the standard Two-Cover Electronic Procurement System.) '
ET
endstream
