(SECTION 2: MANDATORY PRE-QUALIFICATION & FINANCIAL CRITERIA) '
(2.1 Legal Status: The bidder must be an incorporated legal company in business for at least 5 years.) '
(2.2 Minimum Annual Turnover: The bidder shall have an Average Annual Financial Turnover) '
(of not less than INR 5.00 Crore across the last 3 audited financial years \(FY 23, FY 24, FY 25\).) '
(2.3 Net Worth: Must possess positive net worth in each of the last 3 financial years, certified by a CA.) '
(2.4 Earnest Money Deposit \(EMD\): Irrevocable Bank Guarantee of INR 13,00,000 \(2% of contract value\)) '
(valid for 180 days from the submission deadline.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
