(SECTION 3: TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS & ACCREDITATION) '
(3.1 Quality & Security Certifications: Bidder must hold valid ISO 9001:2015 and ISO/IEC 27001:2013) '
(certifications on the date of bid submission.) '
(3.2 Capability Appraisal: Bidders possessing CMMI Level 3 or higher shall receive preference.) '
(3.3 Scalability & Concurrency: Ingestion pipeline must support at least 10,000 edge IoT telemetry nodes) '
(concurrently with message latency below 500 milliseconds.) '
(3.4 High Availability SLA: The platform must deliver 99.9% uptime SLA with active-passive disaster recovery) '
(failover under 5 minutes.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
