(SECTION 4: TIMELINE, STAFFING & CONTRACTUAL CONDITIONS) '
(4.1 Project Schedule: Phase 1 Pilot within 90 days; Full City-wide Commissioning within 180 days.) '
(4.2 Key Personnel: Full-time Project Director with PMP/PRINCE2 credentials and Lead Solution) '
(Architect with minimum 8 years of distributed telemetry systems experience.) '
(4.3 Liquidated Damages \(LD\): Milestone delays shall incur liquidated damages of 0.5% per week of delay,) '
(subject to a maximum ceiling of 10% of total contract value.) '
(4.4 Warranty: Comprehensive 3-year warranty with 4-hour on-site incident response for Severity-1 outages.) '
ET
